44895::$$$message_0395_0000_0000$$$::"Ahh, you've finally come back to me, Saber![wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=愛歌 face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfwww layer=2] First, we'll have tea, and then an afternoon nap. We have so much to talk about!"::

